# R134: ChatGPT R207's cell store: box[0] = k[0:1], then a growth, then a write through the stored slice - v307 printed 7 (the write went to the abandoned elements). Refused from v308.
mukhya() {
    kosh k[1]
    kosh_kship(k, 7)
    vitti obstacle = nirmmita(16)
    mala box[1]
    box[0] = k[0:1]
    kosh_kship(k, 8)
    vitti descriptor = box[0]
    vitti old_data = descriptor[0]
    old_data[0] = 99
    likha(k[0])
}
